BackgroundColor [SimTalk] - lists
Sets the Background Color for all cells of the list/table designated by <Path>.
Remarks
The attribute applies to the objects DataStack, DataQueue, DataList, DataTable, and TimeSequence.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.BackgroundColor:integer
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type integer.
You can specify 1 for Black, 2 for Red, 3 for Green, 4 for Blue, 5 for Magenta, 6 for Yellow, and 7 for
Cyan.
Or set the RGB values of the color with the method makeRGBValue.
