ColumnSeparator [SimTalk]
Sets the Column Separator when saving the list/table designated by <Path> in text format.
Remarks
Note
We strongly advise against using the comma (,) as decimal separator as well as as column separator.
Only use it either as decimal separator or as column separator.
The attribute applies to the objects DataStack, DataQueue, DataList, DataTable, and TimeSequence.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.ColumnSeparator:string
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type string.
You can specify Tab, a blank Space, , (comma), or ; (semicolon).
